      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For a high-traffic legal firm lobby, polished concrete offers excellent durability and a modern, industrial aesthetic with low maintenance. LVT provides a cost-effective, water-resistant option that is very easy to clean and maintain with minimal upkeep. Natural stone like granite is extremely durable and timeless, though it will require more periodic sealing and polishing to maintain its appearance against heavy wear.",
